# Publish after update

When the user asks to fix, update, or ship changes to this repo's 作戰室 sites (HTML/CSS/JS/data the hub serves):

1. If `tools/cap8-r4/execution-state.json` exists and either `mainFrozen` or `publicSiteFrozen` is `true`, the R4 package takes precedence: validate and push checkpoints only to `codex/cap-eight-subject-one-shot-r4`. Do not update `main`, bump the public cache token, publish Pages, or stop the continuous subject sequence.
2. For R4, publish only after `tools/cap8-r4/run-full-release-gate.mjs` passes from the exact clean release commit, then follow the package's backup-tag, normal-integration, Pages, live-verification, and rollback procedure.
3. Outside an active release freeze, run `node tools/run-phase0.mjs` when the change touches subject apps or data, bump affected cache query strings, commit, and push the authorized release branch.
4. After a verified public deployment, tell the user the live URL: https://iasome.github.io/taiwan-cap-math/

Do not commit `tmp_*` scratch files or one-off debug scripts unless the user asks.
